1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,222
Picking fruit on piece rates this summer?

2
00:00:02,222 --> 00:00:04,104
You're still guaranteed a minimum.

3
00:00:04,204 --> 00:00:08,395
One. Under the Horticulture Award, pieceworkers get a daily minimum:

4
00:00:08,395 --> 00:00:12,096
at least the hourly rate for your level, times the hours you worked.

5
00:00:12,096 --> 00:00:16,494
For an adult level one casual, that's thirty-two dollars eighteen an hour.

6
00:00:16,594 --> 00:00:19,213
Two. Pick fast and your piece rate pays more?

7
00:00:19,213 --> 00:00:20,669
You get the higher amount.

8
00:00:20,669 --> 00:00:23,570
And a good day can't be used to cover a slow one.

9
00:00:23,670 --> 00:00:26,673
Three. Before you start, your employer must give you

10
00:00:26,673 --> 00:00:30,007
a written piecework record, with the task and the piece rate.

11
00:00:30,007 --> 00:00:32,454
These rules apply whatever your visa.

12
00:00:32,554 --> 00:00:34,772
Send this to the mate you're picking with.

